ec le bébé (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l3hKqjRlKopffuyPXW4csZtHmWT.jpg"},{"id":18363,"name":"Roland Thénot","role":"Un officier de marine (uncredited)"},{"id":1650,"name":"François Truffaut","role":"Un homme aux fénérailles (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3bXLtipaybsje01LlQvHvuUAZNq.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'uomo che amava le donne","overview":"Bertrand Morane, inappuntabile ingegnere di Montpellier, passa il suo tempo libero ad ammirare, cercare, inseguire le donne. Non è un dongiovanni, non è un viveur né uno psicopatico. Lo fa semplicemente perché con le donne si sente a suo agio e, soprattutto, si sente vivo. Un giorno, la vigilia di Natale del 1976, per seguire una donna, attraversa la strada e muore. La lunga teoria delle sue \"vedove\" sfila sulla sua tomba."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Man Who Loved Women","overview":"At Bertrand Morane's burial there are many of the women that the 40-year-old engineer loved. In flashback Bertrand's life and love affairs are told by himself while writing an autobiographical novel."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Bertrand travaille dans une entreprise d'aérodynamisme. Il est autant amoureux des femmes que de l'idée même de la femme. Pour lui, toutes les femmes sont uniques et irremplaçables. Elles sont à la fois l'œuvre de sa vie, son inspiration artistique et la cause de sa mort. Mais si Bertrand est un amoureux insatiable, c'est que deux profondes blessures sont restées en lui. Celle que lui a causé une mère distante et froide, tout d'abord, et dont il ne parviendra jamais à se faire aimer. Et puis celle que lui a infligée Véra en le quittant. Depuis que Véra est partie, Bertrand erre de femme en femme, les collectionnant pour ne pas s'y attacher. Au fil du temps, il se souvient de toutes les femmes qu'il a rencontrées. Il compose un livre à partir de tous ses souvenirs.","tagline":"« Les jambes des femmes sont des compas qui arpentent le globe terrestre en tous sens, lui donnant son équilibre et son harmonie. »"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrySUeX7Gm0thFh7hrbkPhnirsz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n2lLL7epkunVFtAYiHLDScvvx9l.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1421,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrySUeX7Gm0thFh7hrbkPhnirsz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lrySUeX7Gm0thFh7hrbkPhnirsz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrySUeX7Gm0thFh7hrbkPhnirsz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lrySUeX7Gm0thFh7hrbkPhnirsz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vy9mXtpilDMxDpRIgFmdhQjv4iI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vy9mXtpilDMxDpRIgFmdhQjv4iI.jpg","language":"it","width":1059,"height":1589},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Aij6MmGHrYzGsqFfONLzRLuJdAx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Aij6MmGHrYzGsqFfONLzRLuJdAx.jpg","language":"it","width":538,"height":807}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qAbqXoN6ucpN8jvHOxZOzwyP8pE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qAbqXoN6ucpN8jvHOxZOzwyP8pE.jpg","language":"en","width":1332,"height":2000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qAbqXoN6ucpN8jvHOxZOzwyP8pE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qAbqXoN6ucpN8jvHOxZOzwyP8pE.jpg","language":"en","width":1332,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/doFxMMzi8waOGe0LXj